  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, \\(\\log _{e}\\left(x^{2}-16\\right) \\leq \\log _{e}(4 x-11)\\) if and only if\r\n\\(\\begin{array}{l}\r\nx^{2}-16 \\leq 4 x-11 \\\\\r\n\\Rightarrow x^{2}-4 x-5 \\leq 0 \\\\\r\nx^{2}-5 x+x-5 \\leq 0 \\\\\r\n\\Rightarrow x(x-5)+1(x-5) \\leq 0 \\\\\r\n(x-5)(x+1) \\leq 0\r\n\\end{array}\\)\r\nSign scheme of \\(x^{2}-4 x-5 \\leq 0\\)\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_mat_a80.png\">\r\n\\(-1 \\leq x \\leq 5\\)",
    "image": null
  },
